@{
	Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="instruction-content">
	<ul>
		<li>Commission Group: 4 groups, namely A, B, C and D. Each group has different values for min and max commission.</li>
		<li>Member Commission: the commission rates offered to a member on specific bet types or a group of bet types.</li>
		<li>HDP, OU, OE (%): the commission rate offered to a member on the bet types Handicap (HDP), Over/Under (OU) and Odd/Even (OE).</li>
		<li>1x2 Comm (%): the commission rate offered to a member on the bet type 1x2.</li>
		<li>Other Comm (%): the commission rate offered to a member on the bet types that are not HDP, OU, OE and 1x2.</li>
		<li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be: x <= K <= y.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point. For instance, 1.25 is a valid input, but 1.555 is not.
	</p>
</div>